        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86037, Round Dimpled Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Hammered Cabinet Knob is available in two sizes a small and a large. The hammered design is trending amongst those who want a modern Tuscan Kitchen. The hammered detail adds interest without looking dated.  The Round Dimpled Cabinet Knob is available as satin brass cabinet knobs, oil rubbed bronze kitchen hardware, and satin nickel pulls. Each is packaged with mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/hammered-cabinet-pull-emtek-86046\"><b>Hammered Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Round Hammered Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>86037: Small</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86213: Large</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-artsandcrafts-finish.jpg?v=1704354691\" width=\"345\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
